    "body": "We could have separate set up algorithms for sync vs. async transforms, and thus take away the responsibility of picking the right high water mark from the other spec author. So far other specs haven't needed these extra customization points and I think it might be simpler not to give them out.\r\n\r\n(On the other hand, the fact that existing byte-stream-transform specs are calculating the size of all chunks as 1 is a bit unfortunate...)",
